From af9ed435657ebab9b75209f88f3672eded6a29b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:56:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] design: header as designed in the rounds, spinner only
 inside buttons

The header is one row of three columns (brand, centred sections, search
with Ctrl K, GitHub, Sign in); the landing's lifted bar puts the sections in
a grey tray. Below 760px only brand, GitHub and Sign in remain. Prose link
colour no longer leaks into links drawn as something else.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011CH6tKeE4iJ874reAvf4rR
---
 packages/design/README.md            |  15 ++--
 packages/design/css/base.css         | 120 ++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 packages/design/reference/index.html |   4 +-
 3 files changed, 121 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/design/README.md b/packages/design/README.md
index 817f84a..36d2bb4 100644
--- a/packages/design/README.md
+++ b/packages/design/README.md
@@ -40,11 +40,14 @@ cramped in a pill). No 3D, glow or offset shadows.
 **Signature.** The triangles lattice on the plain page colour, only in side rails, gutters, the landing hero and an
 empty list's patch. Never behind text, never in a header, and no colour stripe along the top.
 
-**Header.** Docs and cloud: a full-width square bar, sticky, with blur and a hairline. The landing page: the same bar
-floating, rounded, at most 1000px wide; below 760px it becomes the full-width bar. Sections (Docs, Playground, Embed)
-are plain links, because some lead to other sites; none is drawn as a selected segment. Actions: search, the GitHub
-mark, Sign in. No "Get started" and no Docs call to action in any header: the landing hero carries the one call to action
-(Download). The cloud's bar holds only the course switcher and the avatar.
